@startuml topic-clustering
' The agglomerative merge loop: distance matrix -> find-min -> Lance-Williams update.
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/topic-clustering.puml
' Source of truth for Figure 1 in docs/components/topic/clustering.md
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #6A1B9A
  BorderColor #263238
  FontColor white
  FontStyle bold
  DiamondBackgroundColor #EF6C00
  DiamondFontColor white
  DiamondBorderColor #263238
}

start
:Compute cosine distance matrix\nupper triangle · atomic u64 · rayon;
:Seed n singleton clusters\nClusterState::new(n);
repeat
  :Find closest active pair (i, j)\nActiveDistanceMatrix::find_minimum;
  :Record merge in linkage\n(i, j, d, size_i + size_j);
  :Lance–Williams update\nd(i ∪ j, k) for each active k;
  :Deactivate i, j · activate new cluster\nClusterState::merge(i, j);
repeat while (more than one active cluster?) is (yes)
->no;
:Build dendrogram\nDendrogram::from_linkage;
:Cut → assignments\ncut_to_k_clusters(k) or cut_at_distance(τ);
stop
@enduml
